1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,420
(The Day of the Audition)

2
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:10,220
Oh, they're here!

3
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,800
Thank you for having me.

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,560
Hello.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,060
Nice to meet you.

6
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,480
No need to be so nervous.

7
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,690
Just be yourself.

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:20,310
Okay.

9
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,730
If I were a woman,

10
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,610
I would love you with all my heart,

11
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:29,450
And fall hopelessly in love with you.

12
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:30,870
Okay, cut!

13
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,780
Thank you.

14
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,330
That was wonderful.

15
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,500
Thank you very much.

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,420
Are these all the candidates
for the lead role of Viola?

17
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:44,920
Hold on a moment.

18
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,670
There's one more...

19
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,800
Minato.

20
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,520
Yes!

21
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:04,400
Minato, why don't you try

22
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,650
reading this line too?

23
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,650
M-Me?

24
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:14,570
Take a deep breath.

25
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:17,740
You'll be fine.

26
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,210
Your words have the power to move people.

27
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:35,050
If I were a woman,

28
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:38,260
I would...

29
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,190
Um, I... I'm sorry.

30
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:49,440
Use that light

31
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,030
to shine upon everyone.

32
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:55,320
(I...)

33
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:58,330
(A place where I can
truly shine...)

34
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:01,580
Please let me try again.

35
00:02:09,670 --> 00:02:12,630
If I were a woman,

36
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:14,680
I would love you with all my heart,

37
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:17,550
And fall hopelessly in love with you.
